// leave in and next to dir, before any chain operation inspects the chain:
//
//   - a merge killed at any point of its sibling swap is repaired exactly as
//     sweepMergeDebris already does (old chain moved back when the chain path
//     is missing; staging/trash siblings removed), but only while no live
//     merge lease guards an in-progress merge;
//   - an expired or corrupt merge sibling lease is removed with the debris;
//   - an expired or corrupt lease.dat inside dir is reclaimed, and a lease
//     temp is swept.
//
// A live lease is never touched, so an operation mid-flight is unaffected.
func recoverChainCoordination(dir string) {
	sweepMergeDebrisLeased(dir)

